- New package: gnome-desktop-testing 2021.1
  Provides gnome-desktop-testing-runner and ginsttest-runner, the
  standard runner for the GNOME installed-tests infrastructure.
  Required to execute installed test suites for GNOME-stack packages
  such as libxmlb, graphene, libjcat, gcab, librsvg, gdk-pixbuf,
  libfprint, upower, xdg-dbus-proxy, and others.
